main at begin do split
main at begin do countParts
main at begin do writeCountLead
main at begin branch ifError writeCountLead goto writeCountLeadDone else goto writeCountLeadDone
main at writeCountLeadDone do writeCount
main at writeCountLeadDone branch ifError writeCount goto writeCountDone else goto writeCountDone
main at writeCountDone do makeBuffer
main at writeCountDone set position partCount
