main at writeLenDone branch ifError findApples goto noApples else goto findApplesDone
main at findApplesDone do writeAtLead
main at findApplesDone branch ifError writeAtLead goto writeAtLeadDone else goto writeAtLeadDone
main at writeAtLeadDone do writeAt
main at writeAtLeadDone branch ifError writeAt goto writeAtDone else goto writeAtDone
main at writeAtDone goto prefixes
main at noApples do writeNo
main at noApples branch ifError writeNo goto writeNoDone else goto writeNoDone
main at writeNoDone goto prefixes
main at prefixes do prefixCheck
main at prefixes branch if starts goto yesPrefix else goto noPrefix
main at yesPrefix do writeYes
main at yesPrefix branch ifError writeYes goto writeYesDone else goto writeYesDone
main at writeYesDone goto bytes
main at noPrefix do writeNoP
main at noPrefix branch ifError writeNoP goto writeNoPDone else goto writeNoPDone
main at writeNoPDone goto bytes
main at bytes do readByte
main at bytes branch ifError readByte goto broken else goto readByteDone
main at readByteDone do asNumber
main at readByteDone do writeByteLead
main at readByteDone branch ifError writeByteLead goto writeByteLeadDone else goto writeByteLeadDone
main at writeByteLeadDone do writeByte
main at writeByteLeadDone branch ifError writeByte goto writeByteDone else goto writeByteDone
main at writeByteDone do equalCheck
main at writeByteDone branch if same goto sameText else goto broken
main at sameText do joinText
main at sameText do writeBoth
main at sameText branch ifError writeBoth goto writeBothDone else goto writeBothDone
main at writeBothDone return ok okCode
main at broken do writeBroken
main at broken branch ifError writeBroken goto writeBrokenDone else goto writeBrokenDone
main at writeBrokenDone return ok okCode

